---
description: Runtime cost rules
globs: ["**/*.java","**/*.sql"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never load a whole table to filter in Java. Filter, aggregate and page in SQL.
- No per-row queries inside loops (N+1). Use one JOIN or GROUP BY query.
- List endpoints must paginate (query params page and size, default size 50) and keep the JSON array response shape.
- Add indexes in schema.sql for columns used in WHERE or JOIN.
- No INFO logging inside per-row code paths.
- Cache expensive read-only aggregates for 60 seconds.
- State the expected impact of each change (queries per request).
